  -- ------------------------------------------------------------ time entries
  -- tech1 (March, p_now 03-05 16:00Z): shift 03-01 03:00-07:00 (1h in March: starts 06:00Z),
  --   shift 03-03 14:00-22:00 (8h) containing job 16:00-19:00, job 03-04 23:00-03-05 01:00 (2h, no shift),
  --   open shift 03-05 13:30 + open job (1005) 14:00 -> 2.5h to p_now. Total 13.5h = 48600 s.
  --   Feb shift 02-20 14:00-19:00 is outside March.
  -- tech2: shift 03-05 12:00-15:00 (3h), job 03-03 16:00-19:30 (3.5h) = 6.5h = 23400 s.
  -- manager: open shift 03-05 14:30 -> 1.5h = 5400 s.  admin: open shift starting 17:00 (after p_now) -> 0.
